> >
> > # graph 2
> > f11 <- factor(f1, levels = c("b", "a"))
> > f22 <- factor(f2, levels = c("d", "c"))
> > qplot(x, y, facets = f11 ~ f22)
> >
> > These two graphs have difference in facets labels.
> >
> > Thank you for attention!
> >
> > Zhang Jianfeng
