You can control the order by changing factor levels:

plot_data$model <- factor(plot_data$model, levels=c("MMNL","GMNL"))

Then just swap the colors you are using in scale_fill_manual:

scale_fill_manual("Model", values = c( grey(0.7),grey(0.1)))

Hope this is what you want J

Kaori

